{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChABtrLKEUEsXRvx2mXmp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the slug bug in `app.py`. The test passes.\n\nThe problem was that `slugify` replaced spaces with underscores. It also didn't handle repeated or leading/trailing spaces. The new version is:\n\n```python\ndef slugify(title):\n    \"\"\"Turn a post title into a URL slug.\"\"\"\n    return \"-\".join(title.lower().split())\n```\n\n`str.split()` with no argument splits on any run of whitespace and drops empty parts. Joining the result with `-` gives hyphens and no empty segments. So `\"Hello World\"` becomes `hello-world`, and `\"  Many   spaces here \"` becomes `many-spaces-here`.\n\nI ran `python3 -m unittest test_app -v` in the workspace and the test passed. I did not modify `test_app.py`. This workspace is not a git repository, so I did not commit anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":9575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":640},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6732264-b47a-46ed-8596-908305fb92de","uuid":"f92031c4-2055-45dd-93a0-b96111f89dc0","timestamp":"2026-11-18T09:52:34.503Z","request_id":"req_011ChABtrBtpHM2hqmyZzt8g"}
